|be]] [[lost]]. [[They]] [[found|find]] Muc [[asleep]] [[in]] [[his]] [[hole]], [[black]] [[from]] [[nose]] [[to]] [[tail]], [[although]] [[with]] Muc [[it]] [[was|be]] [[hard]] [[to]] [[tell]]. [[But]] [[the]] [[top]] [[of]] Green Hill [[was|be]] [[a]] [[different]] [[landscape]]: [[black]] [[trees|tree]] [[without]] [[a]] [[leaf]] [[and]] [[no]] [[shade]] [[anywhere]]. \`[[It]] [[looks|look]] [[like]] an [[alien]] [[planet]],\` [[said|say]] Nhung. \`[[Where]] [[will]] [[the]] [[animals|animal]] [[live]] [[now]]? [[It]] [[was|be]] [[their]] [[habitat]].\``,`vn`:`Kh\u00f4ng ai b\u1ecb th\u01b0\u01a1ng, c\u0169ng kh\u00f4ng m\u1ed9t ng\u00f4i nh\u00e0 n\u00e0o b\u1ecb m\u1ea5t. M\u1ecdi ng\u01b0\u1eddi t\u00ecm th\u1ea5y M\u1ef1c \u0111ang ng\u1ee7 trong c\u00e1i h\u1ed1 c\u1ee7a n\u00f3, \u0111en thui t\u1eeb m\u0169i t\u1edbi \u0111u\u00f4i, d\u00f9 v\u1edbi M\u1ef1c th\u00ec c\u0169ng kh\u00f3 m\u00e0 bi\u1ebft c\u00f3 g\u00ec kh\u00e1c. Nh\u01b0ng \u0111\u1ec9nh \u0111\u1ed3i Xanh \u0111\u00e3 th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t c\u1ea3nh t\u01b0\u1ee3ng kh\u00e1c h\u1eb3n: nh\u1eefng c\u00e1i c\u00e2y \u0111en s\u00ec kh\u00f4ng c\u00f2n m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc l\u00e1, ch\u1eb3ng c\u00f2n ch\u1ed7 n\u00e0o c\u00f3 b\u00f3ng m\u00e1t. \`Tr\u00f4ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t h\u00e0nh tinh xa l\u1ea1 n\u00e0o \u1ea5y,\` Nhung n\u00f3i. \`Gi\u1edd mu\u00f4ng th\u00fa s\u1ed1ng \u1edf \u0111\u00e2u h\u1ea3 \u00f4ng? \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng s\u1ed1ng c\u1ee7a ch\u00fang m\u00e0.\``},{`en`:`[[By]] [[the]] [[dry]] [[stream]], Grandpa [[picked|pick]] [[up]] [[a]] [[stone]] [[that]] [[the]] [[fire]] [[had|have]] [[cracked|crack]] [[open]]. [[Inside]] [[was|be]] [[a]] [[fossil]], [[a]] [[shell]] [[older|old]] [[than]] [[any]] [[forest]]. \`[[This]] [[hill]] [[was|be]] [[once]] [[under]] [[the]] [[sea]],\` [[he]] [[said|say]]. \`[[It]] [[has|have]] [[seen|see]] [[worse]] [[than]] [[one]] [[fire]].\``,`vn`:`B\u00ean con su\u1ed1i c\u1ea1n, \u00f4ng nh\u1eb7t l\u00ean m\u1ed9t h